  "questionAsked": "does locale/locales remove zero commits from twenty (a prediction that picked a segment with no bite), or do they remove commits while the column still did not move (the conjunction blinding the check)?",
  "answer": "NEITHER, and the census names a third state the two-way question did not contain: on twenty, locales is REDUNDANT, not idle.",
